flowchart LR
    subgraph clients["Entry points"]
        U1["Web console<br/>(App Service)"]
        U2["Foundry agent"]
        U3["Microsoft 365 Copilot<br/>(MCP connector)"]
    end
    subgraph rg["Isolated resource group"]
        MCP["MCP server<br/>(App Service)"]
        S["Azure AI Search<br/>index + knowledge base"]
        AOAI["Foundry<br/>gpt-5-mini, embeddings"]
        F["Download function<br/>(Flex Consumption)"]
        FS[("Azure Files<br/>admin-share / alluser-share")]
        KV["Key Vault"]
    end
    ENTRA["Microsoft Entra ID<br/>users, groups, 3 app registrations"]

    U1 -->|user token| MCP
    U2 -->|MCP connection| S
    U3 -->|SSO token| MCP
    MCP -->|"OBO: token on behalf of the user"| S
    S -->|indexers| FS
    S -->|vectorization, reasoning| AOAI
    U1 & U2 & U3 -.->|document link| F
    F -->|group check, then read| FS
    F & MCP -.-> KV
    ENTRA -.-> MCP & F & U1
